# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own value: cp .env.example .env
#
# Getting your ssid: sign in at https://auth.riotgames.com in a browser (tick "Stay signed in"),
# then F12 → Application → Cookies → auth.riotgames.com → copy the value of ssid.
# You can also paste a whole cookie string (e.g. ssid=...; clid=...).
# ⚠️ Your ssid is equivalent to a logged-in session. Never share it or commit it to git.
SSID=
